messages.content:
Analyze the Jira bug report title and description and the seed changes that were made to fix the reported bug. Combine this analysis with the initial static impact set, which contains the fully qualified names of code entities that are statically related to the seed changes.
For each entity in the initial static impact set, analyze its relationship to the seed changes and collect evidence indicating whether the entity must be modified as a consequence of the seed changes.  Furthermore, identify any additional code entities that must be modified or created and collect supporting evidence.
Focus on production code, not test code or other files.
Inputs: - Jira bug report title: ConfigurationConverter does not handle CompositeConfiguration correctly - Jira bug report description: ConfigurationConverter doesn't seem to respect the ordering of a composite configuration. I am having problems describing the behavior, but I thinks the following test case illustrates it best:

	@Test
	public void showBug() {
		PropertiesConfiguration p = new PropertiesConfiguration();
		p.addProperty("foo", "initial");
		p.addProperty("bar", "${foo}");
		p.addProperty("prefix.foo", "override");

		CompositeConfiguration cfg = new CompositeConfiguration();
		cfg.addConfiguration(p.subset("prefix"));
		cfg.addConfiguration(p);

		// this assertion passes as expected since the subset
		// was added first to the composite configuration
		Assert.assertEquals("override", cfg.getString("bar"));

		// after converting to properties, this assertion fails and
		// reports that the value is 'initial'
		Properties properties = ConfigurationConverter.getProperties(cfg);
		Assert.assertEquals("override", properties.getProperty("bar"));
	} - Seed changes and their Git diff hunks: [{"fqn": "org.apache.commons.configuration.CompositeConfiguration.getList(java.lang.String,java.util.List)", "git_diff_hunk": "@@ -297 +297 @@ implements Cloneable
- list.addAll(config.getList(key));
+ appendListProperty(list, config, key);
@@ -302 +302 @@ implements Cloneable
- list.addAll(inMemoryConfiguration.getList(key));
+ appendListProperty(list, inMemoryConfiguration, key);"}] - Initial static code change impact set: ["org.apache.commons.configuration.AbstractConfiguration.getList(java.lang.String,java.util.List)", "org.apache.commons.configuration.AbstractConfiguration.interpolate(java.lang.Object)", "org.apache.commons.configuration.CompositeConfiguration.CompositeConfiguration()", "org.apache.commons.configuration.CompositeConfiguration.CompositeConfiguration(java.util.Collection)", "org.apache.commons.configuration.CompositeConfiguration.CompositeConfiguration(org.apache.commons.configuration.Configuration)", "org.apache.commons.configuration.CompositeConfiguration.CompositeConfiguration(org.apache.commons.configuration.Configuration,java.util.Collection)", "org.apache.commons.configuration.CompositeConfiguration.clear()", "org.apache.commons.configuration.CompositeConfiguration.clone()", "org.apache.commons.configuration.CompositeConfiguration.configList", "org.apache.commons.configuration.CompositeConfiguration.inMemoryConfiguration", "org.apache.commons.configuration.Configuration.containsKey(java.lang.String)", "org.apache.commons.configuration.Configuration.getList(java.lang.String)", "org.apache.commons.configuration.ConfigurationUtils.appendListProperty(java.util.List,org.apache.commons.configuration.Configuration,java.lang.String)", "org.apache.commons.configuration.PropertyConverter.interpolate(java.lang.Object,org.apache.commons.configuration.AbstractConfiguration)"]

Expected output:
Structured evidence for each entity of the initial static impact set, including: - its fully qualified name - an assessment of whether it must be modified as a consequence of the seed changes - the supporting evidence
Additionally, include any code entities that must be modified or created but are not part of the initial static impact set.
